<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Shoop Kamatcho - Thrift Store</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f4f4f4; color: #333; line-height: 1.6; }
        header { background-color: #8B4513; color: white; text-align: center; padding: 20px; }
        nav { background-color: #D2691E; padding: 10px; text-align: center; }
        nav a { color: white; margin: 0 15px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; }
        nav a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
        section { padding: 20px; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; }
        footer { background-color: #8B4513; color: white; text-align: center; padding: 10px; }
        .product-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }
        .product { border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px; text-align: center; background-color: white; border-radius: 5px; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
        .product img { max-width: 100%; height: auto; }
        form { max-width: 400px; margin: 0 auto; }
        input, textarea { width: 100%; padding: 10px; margin: 5px 0; border: 1px solid #ccc; border-radius: 4px; }
        button { background-color: #D2691E; color: white; padding: 10px; border: none; cursor: pointer; width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 16px; }
        button:hover { background-color: #8B4513; }
        .success { display: none; color: green; text-align: center; margin-top: 10px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>Welcome to Shoop Kamatcho Thrift Store</h1>
        <p>Where vintage treasures meet affordable style!</p>
    </header>
    
    <nav>
        <a href="#home">Home</a>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#products">Products</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
    
    <section id="home">
        <h2>Home</h2>
        <p>Discover unique, pre-loved items at Shoop Kamatcho. From funky clothes to quirky accessories, we've got the thrift you need!</p>
        <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/800x300?text=Shoop+Kamatcho+Thrift+Store" alt="Store Image" style="width:100%; max-width:800px;">
    </section>
    
    <section id="about">
        <h2>About Us</h2>
        <p>Shoop Kamatcho is your go-to thrift store for sustainable fashion and one-of-a-kind finds. Founded in 2023, we believe in giving clothes a second life while keeping prices low and vibes high. Come shop with us and reduce, reuse, recycle!</p>
    </section>
    
    <section id="products">
        <h2>Products</h2>
        <div class="product-grid">
            <div class="product">
                <h3>Vintage T-Shirts</h3>
                <p>Retro designs from the '80s and '90s. $5 each!</p>
                <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/200x150?text=T-Shirt" alt="T-Shirt">
            </div>
            <div class="product">
                <h3>Denim Jeans</h3>
                <p>Well-worn jeans in various sizes. $10 each!</p>
                <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/200x150?text=Jeans" alt="Jeans">
            </div>
            <div class="product">
                <h3>Accessories</h3>
                <p>Hats, belts, and more. Starting at $3!</p>
                <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/200x150?text=Accessories" alt="Accessories">
            </div>
            <div class="product">
                <h3>Miscellaneous</h3>
                <p>Books, toys, and oddities. Bargain prices!</p>
                <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/200x150?text=Misc" alt="Misc">
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    
    <section id="contact">
        <h2>Contact Us</h2>
        <p>Visit us at 123 Thrift Lane, Funkytown, USA. Call: (555) 123-4567. Email: info@shoopkamatcho.com</p>
        <p>Or send us a message below:</p>
        <form id="contactForm" action="https://formspree.io/f/YOUR_FORM_ID" method="POST">
            <label for="name">Name:</label>
            <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required>
            
            <label for="email">Email:</label>
            <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required>
            
            <label for="message">Message:</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="5" required></textarea>
            
            <button type="submit">Send Message</button>
        </form>
        <div id="successMessage" class="success">Thank you! Your message has been sent.</div>
    </section>
    
    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2023 Shoop Kamatcho. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>

    <script>
        // Simple JavaScript for form submission feedback
        document.getElementById('contactForm').addEventListener('submit', function(event) {
            // Show success message after submission (Formspree handles the actual send)
            setTimeout(function() {
                document.getElementById('successMessage').style.display = 'block';
            }, 1000);
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
